ass=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e9/Poisoned_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Poisoned_(Condition)\" title=\"Poisoned (Condition)\">Poisoned</a> for 2 turns.</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Acid_(surface)\" title=\"Acid (surface)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Acid_surface_Icon.webp/20px-Acid_surface_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Acid_surface_Icon.webp/30px-Acid_surface_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Acid_surface_Icon.webp/40px-Acid_surface_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Acid\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Acid_surface_Icon.webp/20px-Acid_surface_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Acid_surface_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Acid_(surface)\" title=\"Acid (surface)\">Acid</a>: Apply <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Acid_(Condition)\" title=\"Acid (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/28/Acid_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Acid_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/28/Acid_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Acid_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/28/Acid_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Acid_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Acid\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/28/Acid_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Acid_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/28/Acid_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Acid_(Condition)\" title=\"Acid (Condition)\">Acid</a> for 2 turns.</li></ul></li>\n<li>Nature's Vengeance does not work with any other surfaces. This includes the other basic elemental surfaces like <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ice_(surface)\" title=\"Ice (surface)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/89/Ice_surface_Icon.webp/20px-Ice_surface_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/89/Ice_surface_Icon.webp/30px-Ice_surface_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/89/Ice_surface_Icon.webp/40px-Ice_surface_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ice\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/89/Ice_surface_Icon.webp/20px-Ice_surface_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/89/Ice_surface_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Ice_(surface)\" title=\"Ice (surface)\">Ice</a> surfaces or <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Electrified_Water\" title=\"Electrified Water\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/75/Electrified_Water_surface_Icon.webp/20px-Electrified_Water_surface_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/75/Electrified_Water_surface_Icon.webp/30px-Electrified_Water_surface_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/75/Electrified_Water_surface_Icon.webp/40px-Electrified_Water_surface_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Electrified Water\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/75/Electrified_Water_surface_Icon.webp/20px-Electrified_Water_surface_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/75/Electrified_Water_surface_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Electrified_Water\" title=\"Electrified Water\">Electrified Water</a> surfaces.</li>\n<li>Valid poison surfaces can be created by breaking <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=